{"html_text": {"ja452:0.1": "<article id='ja452'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja452:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja452:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja452:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja452:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja452:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja452:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja452:11.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja452:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja452:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja452:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja452:0.4": "14. Bhūripaññajātaka ", "ja452:1.1": "“Saccaṁ kira tvaṁ api bhūripañña, ", "ja452:1.2": "Yā tādisī sīri dhitī matī ca; ", "ja452:1.3": "Na tāyatebhāvavasūpanitaṁ, ", "ja452:1.4": "Yo yavakaṁ bhuñjasi appasūpaṁ”. ", "ja452:2.1": "“Sukhaṁ dukkhena paripācayanto, ", "ja452:2.2": "Kālā kālaṁ vicinaṁ chandachanno; ", "ja452:2.3": "Atthassa dvārāni avāpuranto, ", "ja452:2.4": "Tenāhaṁ tussāmi yavodanena. ", "ja452:3.1": "Kālañca ñatvā abhijīhanāya, ", "ja452:3.2": "Mantehi atthaṁ paripācayitvā; ", "ja452:3.3": "Vijambhissaṁ sīhavijambhitāni, ", "ja452:3.4": "Tāyiddhiyā dakkhasi maṁ punāpi”. ", "ja452:4.1": "“Sukhīpi heke na karonti pāpaṁ, ", "ja452:4.2": "Avaṇṇasaṁsaggabhayā puneke; ", "ja452:4.3": "Pahū samāno vipulatthacintī, ", "ja452:4.4": "Kiṅkāraṇā me na karosi dukkhaṁ”. ", "ja452:5.1": "“Na paṇḍitā attasukhassa hetu, ", "ja452:5.2": "Pāpāni kammāni samācaranti; ", "ja452:5.3": "Dukkhena phuṭṭhā khalitāpi santā, ", "ja452:5.4": "Chandā ca dosā na jahanti dhammaṁ”. ", "ja452:6.1": "“Yena kenaci vaṇṇena, ", "ja452:6.2": "mudunā dāruṇena vā; ", "ja452:6.3": "Uddhare dīnamattānaṁ, ", "ja452:6.4": "pacchā dhammaṁ samācare”. ", "ja452:7.1": "“Yassa rukkhassa chāyāya, ", "ja452:7.2": "nisīdeyya sayeyya vā; ", "ja452:7.3": "Na tassa sākhaṁ bhañjeyya, ", "ja452:7.4": "mittadubbho hi pāpako. ", "ja452:8.1": "Yassāpi dhammaṁ puriso vijaññā, ", "ja452:8.2": "Ye cassa kaṅkhaṁ vinayanti santo; ", "ja452:8.3": "Taṁ hissa dīpañca parāyanañca, ", "ja452:8.4": "Na tena mettiṁ jarayetha pañño”. ", "ja452:9.1": "“Alaso gihī kāmabhogī na sādhu, ", "ja452:9.2": "Asaññato pabbajito na sādhu; ", "ja452:9.3": "Rājā na sādhu anisammakārī, ", "ja452:9.4": "Yo paṇḍito kodhano taṁ na sādhu. ", "ja452:10.1": "Nisamma khattiyo kayirā, ", "ja452:10.2": "nānisamma disampati; ", "ja452:10.3": "Nisammakārino rāja, ", "ja452:10.4": "yaso kitti ca vaḍḍhatī”ti. ", "ja452:11.1": "Bhūripaññajātakaṁ cuddasamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja452:0.1": "", "ja452:0.2": "", "ja452:0.3": "", "ja452:0.4": "", "ja452:1.1": "tvaṁ api → tvampi (bj); tuvampi (sya1ed, sya2ed); tvaṁ asi (mr) ", "ja452:1.2": "", "ja452:1.3": "", "ja452:1.4": "", "ja452:2.1": "", "ja452:2.2": "", "ja452:2.3": "", "ja452:2.4": "", "ja452:3.1": "", "ja452:3.2": "", "ja452:3.3": "", "ja452:3.4": "", "ja452:4.1": "Sukhīpi heke → sukhīhi eke (bj); sukhīti heke (?) ", "ja452:4.2": "", "ja452:4.3": "", "ja452:4.4": "", "ja452:5.1": "", "ja452:5.2": "", "ja452:5.3": "", "ja452:5.4": "", "ja452:6.1": "", "ja452:6.2": "", "ja452:6.3": "", "ja452:6.4": "", "ja452:7.1": "", "ja452:7.2": "", "ja452:7.3": "", "ja452:7.4": "", "ja452:8.1": "Yassāpi → yassāhi (bj, mr) | puriso → manujo (bj) ", "ja452:8.2": "", "ja452:8.3": "", "ja452:8.4": "", "ja452:9.1": "", "ja452:9.2": "", "ja452:9.3": "", "ja452:9.4": "", "ja452:10.1": "", "ja452:10.2": "", "ja452:10.3": "", "ja452:10.4": "", "ja452:11.1": "Bhūripaññajātakaṁ → bhūripañhājātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); bhūripañhajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja452:0.1": "", "ja452:0.2": "", "ja452:0.3": "", "ja452:0.4": "", "ja452:1.1": "bj30.380, ms22J_2066, msdiv145, ndp22.213, pts-vp-pli4.72, vri68.175", "ja452:1.2": "", "ja452:1.3": "", "ja452:1.4": "", "ja452:2.1": "dr27.295, ms22J_2067, msdiv146, sya27.297", "ja452:2.2": "", "ja452:2.3": "", "ja452:2.4": "", "ja452:3.1": "csp1ed22.221, csp2ed22.221, ms22J_2068, msdiv147", "ja452:3.2": "", "ja452:3.3": "", "ja452:3.4": "", "ja452:4.1": "ms22J_2069, msdiv148", "ja452:4.2": "", "ja452:4.3": "", "